OL,3,AFour works of art, worth millions,
OL,4,Astolen from Renoir museum in France
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe museum's alarm went off at 05:48
OL,7,Flocal time (04:48 BST), with police
OL,8,Farriving five minutes later - here's
OL,9,Fwhat we know so far
OL,11,FThe thieves have not been caught, the
OL,12,Fmayor adds
OL,14,FThe theft at the Musee Renoir, in
OL,15,FCagnes-sur-Mer on the French Riviera,
OL,16,Ffollows a multi-million euro heist at
OL,17,Fthe Louvre in Paris last year
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/18
